  <p>The shorter leg is five times the scale factor.</p>
  <p><span set:html={rich('[[[a = 5k]]]')} /></p>
  <p>Use <span set:html={rich('[[k = 4]]')} />: <span set:html={rich('[[[a = 5 \\times 4 = 20]]]')} /></p>
  <p>The shorter leg is 20 units long. It is the smallest side at every scale factor, because 5 is the smallest number in the ratio.</p>
