  <p><span set:html={rich('[[[b = 12k]]]')} /></p>
  <p>Use <span set:html={rich('[[k = 4]]')} />: <span set:html={rich('[[[b = 12 \\times 4 = 48]]]')} /></p>
  <p>The longer leg is 48 units long. It is longer than the shorter leg because 12 is larger than 5, but it is still shorter than the hypotenuse at every positive scale factor.</p>
