  <p><span set:html={rich('[[[c = 13k]]]')} /></p>
  <p>Use <span set:html={rich('[[k = 4]]')} />: <span set:html={rich('[[[c = 13 \\times 4 = 52]]]')} /></p>
  <p>The hypotenuse is 52 units long. It stays the longest side at every positive scale factor, because 13 is the largest number in the ratio and the hypotenuse always sits opposite the right angle.</p>
